# Frontend Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env only if you want to override the default settings.
#
# NOTE FOR LOCAL & WI-FI USE:
# You do NOT need to set or hardcode any IP address here!
# The app automatically detects whatever Wi-Fi IP or host you open it from
# (laptop, phone, tablet) and routes API requests to :8080 dynamically.
#
# Set this ONLY if deploying to a remote production domain:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com